 justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30 Set)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30 Nov)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18 e 19 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre do Porto 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 32\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 20 de Dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na Avenida dos Aliados, no centro do Porto, \u00e0s 18:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra a Corrida oficial de 10 km cronometrada por chip e a Caminhada familiar de 5 km sem fins competitivos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos kits de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega decorre no Alameda Shop &#038; Spot nos dias 18 e 19 de dezembro (10h \u00e0s 23h) e no Gabinete do Mun\u00edcipe a 20 de dezembro (14h \u00e0s 17h).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico, camisola t\u00e9cnica oficial de manga comprida, medalha comemorativa de finalista, abastecimentos e seguro desportivo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Runporto e Porto AntiStress Clube, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal do Porto e da \u00c1gora.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre do Porto 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida dos Aliados, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Porto\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Porto AntiStress Clube e Runporto (apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal do Porto e \u00c1gora)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre do Porto 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 32\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 20 de Dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na Avenida dos Aliados, no centro do Porto, \u00e0s 18:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra a Corrida oficial de 10 km cronometrada por chip e a Caminhada familiar de 5 km sem fins competitivos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos kits de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega decorre no Alameda Shop & Spot nos dias 18 e 19 de dezembro (10h \u00e0s 23h) e no Gabinete do Mun\u00edcipe a 20 de dezembro (14h \u00e0s 17h).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico, camisola t\u00e9cnica oficial de manga comprida, medalha comemorativa de finalista, abastecimentos e seguro desportivo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Runporto e Porto AntiStress Clube, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal do Porto e da \u00c1gora.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66349,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[47,672,27,28],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"